{"4819240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wreckwake Endless Sea", "steam_appid": 4819240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4826470], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Wreckwake: Endless Sea** is a top-down 2D naval action roguelite built around physical cable weapons, tactical towing, and high-risk salvage recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command an armored hunter vessel across an endless hostile ocean. Instead of conventional guns, your ship fights with retractable weapons: drag enemy vessels with the Main Claw, pierce targets with returning spears, or anchor spinning saws into their hulls. Every weapon has its own movement, impact, elemental upgrades, and ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies leave valuable salvage behind, but rewards are not collected automatically. Deploy Resource Nets to capture cargo and tow it back while surviving enemy fleets, sea monsters, and increasingly dangerous bosses. Choose upgrades during each voyage, develop specialized weapon builds, unlock permanent talents, and adapt your strategy across multiple difficulty modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the weight of every cable, build a powerful salvage fleet, and survive as long as you can on the Endless Sea.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Wreckwake: Endless Sea** is a top-down 2D naval action roguelite built around physical cable weapons, tactical towing, and high-risk salvage recovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command an armored hunter vessel across an endless hostile ocean. Instead of conventional guns, your ship fights with retractable weapons: drag enemy vessels with the Main Claw, pierce targets with returning spears, or anchor spinning saws into their hulls. Every weapon has its own movement, impact, elemental upgrades, and ultimate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies leave 